        sensitive App Secret never lives in the app.

        Collection is held OFF at boot: AndroidManifest sets
        com.facebook.sdk.AutoLogAppEventsEnabled / AdvertiserIDCollectionEnabled
        to false, and FacebookAnalyticsService.initialize() turns them on at
        runtime (Android has no ATT gate). fb_login_protocol_scheme is omitted —
        Facebook Login is unused; add it back as fb<AppID> only if adopted.
